Description: An R interface to 'Starsim' <https://starsim.org>, a fast, flexible disease modeling framework written in 'Python', which runs the same model as a compartmental (ODE), stochastic, or agent-based model. Models are written and run from R, with results as data frames and plots on R graphics devices.
URL: https://r.starsim.org/
BugReports: https://github.com/starsimhub/rstarsim/issues
